cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ORACC-TF conversion software, cite this repository and the
  exact Git revision. If you use its datasets, separately cite the source
  ORACC projects, the relevant upstream text editions, and the specific
  released dataset identity recorded in manifest.json.
type: software
title: "ORACC-TF: conversion software for ORACC Text-Fabric corpora"
authors:
  - name: "ORACC-TF contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexsosn/ORACC-TF"
url: "https://github.com/alexsosn/ORACC-TF"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  ORACC-TF is conversion software for building Text-Fabric datasets from
  ORACC source exports. The MIT licence applies to this project's software;
  it does not license or relicense upstream ORACC corpus data, translations,
  annotations, metadata or scholarly editions. Cite the original projects,
  editors, and their source-specific rights statements separately.
keywords:
  - text-fabric
  - ORACC
  - digital humanities
  - cuneiform
  - corpus conversion
